# Execution Permission Gate

- Before any repository/script execution, ask:
  1) whether the current workspace/session is on HPC, and
  2) whether the user gives permission to execute now.
- If HPC is not confirmed, do not execute repository scripts.
- If HPC is confirmed but permission is not granted, do not execute scripts.
- Only execute when both are true: HPC confirmed and explicit user permission.

# Examples

```bash
# Ask first:
# "Is this workspace/session on HPC?"
# "Do you want me to execute this now?"

# ❌ If not HPC or no permission, do not run
python train_surrogate_spinup.py --case ABBY_ppe6_I20TRCNPRDCTCBC

# ✅ Only if HPC is confirmed and user approved execution
python train_surrogate_spinup.py --case ABBY_ppe6_I20TRCNPRDCTCBC
```
